<title>USA: U.S. bank borrowings avg $37 mln/day Feb 12 week.</title>
<headline>U.S. bank borrowings avg $37 mln/day Feb 12 week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said U.S. bank discount window borrowings, less extended credits, averaged $37 million per day in the week ended February 12.</p>
<p>Extended credits were nil.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
</text>
